<title>SOUTH KOREA: Kia Motors to provide tech to China firm.</title>
<headline>Kia Motors to provide tech to China firm.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Kia Motors Corp said on Monday it had agreed with China's Yue Fa Automobile Co Ltd to supply technical assistance in manufacturing key components for passenger cars.</p>
<p>Yue Fa, based in Jiangsu province, will pay Kia $3 million plus royalties, a Kia spokesman said.</p>
<p>He said details on royalties and other commercial terms were still under negotiations between the two companies.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
